Mathlib/RingTheory/Regular/RegularSequence.lean:14:# Regular sequences and weakly regular sequences
Mathlib/RingTheory/Regular/RegularSequence.lean:16:The notion of a regular sequence is fundamental in commutative algebra.
Mathlib/RingTheory/Regular/RegularSequence.lean:17:Properties of regular sequences encode information about singularities of a
Mathlib/RingTheory/Regular/RegularSequence.lean:18:ring and regularity of a sequence can be tested homologically.
Mathlib/RingTheory/Regular/RegularSequence.lean:19:However the notion of a regular sequence is only really sensible for Noetherian local rings.
